abstract: >-
  Code and summary data that regenerate every figure and table of a manuscript
  examining how zero-shot chain-of-thought prompt prefixes shape the hidden-state
  trajectories of large language models. Large raw artifacts and rendered figures
  are archived separately on Zenodo.
keywords:
  - chain-of-thought
  - prompt engineering
  - hidden states
  - logit lens
  - reproducibility
